// CONTRACT BEAT (owned by mid): trades the goldTooth for hmStrength (north's
// victoryRoadBoulders gate, with the Bloom Badge). The tooth goes back where
// it belongs, so it leaves the bag.

## The warden's house

::bg{location="warden-house" time="day"}
::auto{character="wardenHolt" anchor="center" action="enter"}
@wardenHolt{emotion="sad"}: Hwah? Ish that... ish that mah teef? Mah gold teef! Ah losht 'em in the Pweserve!
@narrator: Warden Holt takes the gold tooth, gives it a polish on his sleeve, and puts it back in with a click.
::retract{hasItem(goldTooth)}
@wardenHolt{emotion="happy"}: Ah, much better. Thank you, young trainer. I can whistle for my Ranger again!
@wardenHolt: Take this. My old Bullrush moved boulders with it for thirty years. It's retired now. It moves sofas.
::use{component="obtain" item="hmStrength"}
@wardenHolt: With the Bloom Badge, your monsters can use Strength outside of battle. The boulders on Victory Road won't know what hit them.
